Subject: Declare Guava failureaccess after DHI Guava 33.7.2-jre bump

Origin: DHI-internal (cassandra package build)
Description: Guava 32.x and later ship failureaccess as a separate runtime jar. After cassandra-4-mvn-dependencies.json rewrites build.xml to Guava 33.7.2-jre and snappy-java 1.1.10.9, this hunk adds the explicit failureaccess dependency and drops the stale exclusion so Ant resolves the runtime classpath correctly.
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/apache/cassandra.git 2ddb92091c05f8cde2c8c28e1abda43788c3117f
Verify: sbom pkg:maven/com.google.guava/failureaccess@1.0.2
Forwarded: not-needed (compatibility with DHI Maven dependency overrides only)
Drop-When: never: upstream build.xml still excludes failureaccess after DHI pins Guava 33.7.2-jre via cassandra-4-mvn-dependencies.json
CVE: CVE-2026-102554

Guava 33.7.2-jre is pinned in package/main/cassandra/patch/cassandra-4-mvn-dependencies.json before git/patch applies this build.xml hunk against the tracked cassandra-4.1.12 source checkout.

diff --git a/build.xml b/build.xml
index bb5b50e..8d90e2c 100644
--- a/build.xml
+++ b/build.xml
@@ -548,11 +548,11 @@
           <dependency groupId="org.xerial.snappy" artifactId="snappy-java" version="1.1.10.9"/>
           <dependency groupId="at.yawk.lz4" artifactId="lz4-java" version="1.11.4"/>
           <dependency groupId="com.github.luben" artifactId="zstd-jni" version="1.5.7-2"/>
+          <dependency groupId="com.google.guava" artifactId="failureaccess" version="1.0.2"/>
           <dependency groupId="com.google.guava" artifactId="guava" version="33.7.2-jre">
             <exclusion groupId="com.google.code.findbugs" artifactId="jsr305" />
             <exclusion groupId="org.codehaus.mojo" artifactId="animal-sniffer-annotations" />
             <exclusion groupId="com.google.guava" artifactId="listenablefuture" />
-            <exclusion groupId="com.google.guava" artifactId="failureaccess" />
             <exclusion groupId="org.checkerframework" artifactId="checker-qual" />
             <exclusion groupId="com.google.errorprone" artifactId="error_prone_annotations" />
           </dependency>
